{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":140,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ. ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܕܘܝܕ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܦܲܨܝܼ ܠܝܼ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܡ̣ܢ ܒܲܪܢܵܫܵܐ ܒܝܼܫܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡ̣ܢ ܐܢܵܫܹ̈ܐ ܛܵܠܘܿܡܹ̈ܐ ܢܵܛܪܹܬ ܠܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܢܝܼ ܕܚܫܝܼܒ݂ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܒܝܼܫܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ ܒܠܸܒܵܝܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܟܠܹܗ ܝܵܘܡܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܚܲܦܛܝܼ ܦܠܵܫܹ̈ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܚܪܸܦ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܠܸܫܵܢܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܚܘܼܘܹܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܲܡܵܐ ܕܐܸܣܦܸܣ ܬܚܘܿܬ ܣܸܦܘܵܬܵܝ̈ܗ‌ܝ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܢܛܘܿܪܝܼ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܡ̣ܢ ܐܝܼܕܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ ܕܪ̈ܲܫܝܼܥܹܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡ̣ܢ ܐܢܵܫܹ̈ܐ ܛܵܠܘܿܡܹ̈ܐ ܢܵܛܪܹܬ ܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܢܝܼ ܕܚܫܝܼܒ݂ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܠܬܲܪܩܘܼܠܹܐ ܦܵܣܘܿܥܝܵܬ‌ܝܼ̈.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܛܘܼܡܸܪܗܘܿܢ ܫܲܒ݂ܗܸܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ ܢܸܫܒ݂ܵܐ ܐܸܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܒܚܲܒ݂ܠܹ̈ܐ ܦܪܝܼܣ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܓܲܪܕܵܐ ܥܲܠܔ ܐܘܼܪܚܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܲܚܹ̈ܐ ܨܘܼܠܹܐ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܐܸܠܝܼ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܡܝܼܪܝܼ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ: ”ܐܲܠܵܗ‌ܝܼ ܝܘܸܬ ܐܲܢ݇ܬ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܒ݂ܠܔ ܢܵܬܵ‌ܐ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܠܩܵܠܵܐ ܕܢܵܘܢܲܝܬ‌ܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܚܲܝܠܵܐ ܕܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܘܼܣܹܐ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܪܹܝܫܝܼ ܒܝܵܘܡܵܐ ܕܦܠܵܫܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܠܵܐ ܝܵܗܒܹܬ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܫܲܗܘܲܬܝܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ ܕܪ̈ܲܫܝܼܥܹܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܢܝܼܫܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܠܵܐ ܫܵܒ݂ܩܹܬ ܦܵܠܹܛ ܒܪܹܝܫܵܐ ܕܠܵܐ ܪܵܝܡܝܼ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܪܹܝܫܵܐ ܕܚܲܪ̈ܕܝܼܵܢܝܼ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܵܐܹܫ ܟܘܼܣܝܵܐ ܒܦܸܠܡܵܐ ܕܣܸܦܘܵܬܵܝ̈ܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܫܒ݂ܘܿܩ ܨܵܠܝܼ ܥܲܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܓܘܼܡܪܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܓܵܘ ܢܘܼܪܵܐ ܦܵܝܫܝܼ ܡܘܼܢܦܸܠܔ ܠܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܓܵܘ ܥܘܼܡܩܹ̈ܐ، ܕܠܵܐ ܩܵܝܡܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܕܵܪܝܵܢܵܐ ܕܒܘܼܚܬܵܢ ܠܹܐ ܩܵܘܹܐ ܒܐܲܪܥܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܢܵܫܵܐ ܛܵܠܘܿܡܵܐ ܒܝܼܫܬܵ‌ܐ ܒܸܬ ܨܵܝܕܵܐ ܠܹܗ ܒܓ̰ܲܠܕܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ.“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܝܵܕܥܹܢ ܕܒܸܬ ܥܵܒܹܕ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܕܝܼܢܵܐ ܕܡܘܼܠܝܸܨܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܝܼܘܵܢ ܕܡܸܣܟܹܢܹ̈ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܫܪܵܪܵܐ، ܙܲܕܝܼܩܹ̈ܐ ܒܸܬ ܫܲܟܪܝܼ ܠܫܸܡܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܝܵܬܒ݂ܝܼ ܬܪ̈ܘܼܨܹܐ ܩܲܕܡ ܦܵܬܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/140.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/141.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/139.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}